get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/players/online?limit=100
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## Online players

  List characters that are currently in the world.

  - Method and path: `GET /api/v1/players/online?limit=100`.
  - Path parameters: none.
  - Query parameters: `limit` (optional). 0, invalid, or missing values use `100`; values above
    `500` clamp to `500`.
  - Body: none.
  - Signature headers: `X-GM-Timestamp`, `X-GM-Nonce`, `X-GM-Signature`, set by `collection.bru`.
    No `X-GM-Actor`, no RBAC permission.
  - Success: `200` with an array of
    `{"guid","name","account_id","level","race","class","map","zone"}`, ordered by GUID.
  - Failure: `401 unauthorized`, `405 method_not_allowed`, `409 replayed_nonce`,
    `429 rate_limited`, `503 world_unavailable`.

  Empty array means no character is in the world. The read runs on the world thread; a stalled
  world thread returns `503`.
}
